TL;DR: TypeScript strict · Next.js App Router · tRPC+Zod · Prisma/Supabase · Auth.js · Tailwind+shadcn ·
stockfish.wasm client-side · FSRS · Vitest+Playwright · Vercel. Boundaries: engine/ & analysis/ never
import the reverse and hold no science constants; methodology/ imports only lib/ + engine/math; db/ has
no business logic. Laws: L1 science only in config, L2 pure/deterministic (inject Clock, no Date.now/
Math.random), L3 every methodology leaf a GradedValue. Done = green CI (typecheck→lint→unit→build→e2e→
guards). Phase-1: no payments, native apps, social, hosted content, LLM at runtime.
